// AdmitHostResponse carries what the admitting node knows of the name's audit
// chain: the last seq a host under this name wrote, and that row's content hash.
// Both are zero for a name with no history. `lv host add` signs them with the
// cluster CA and hands them to the new machine, whose daemon holds its own audit
// rows until its replica has that row — so a host rebuilt under an old name
